    <table class="wikitable nounderlines nowrap" border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; text-align:center; " about="#mwt41" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:ExpandedAttrs" id="mwhA" data-mw="{&quot;attribs&quot;:[[{&quot;txt&quot;:&quot;class&quot;,&quot;html&quot;:&quot;class=\&quot;wikitable nounderlines nowrap\&quot; border=\&quot;1\&quot; style=\&quot;border-collapse:collapse; text-align:center; \&quot;&quot;,&quot;uneditable&quot;:true},{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;&quot;}]],&quot;parts&quot;:[&quot;{|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-table-header1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-table-header1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Code page 437&lt;ref name=\&quot;Unicode_1996_437\&quot;/&gt;&lt;ref name=\&quot;cpgid437pdf\&quot;/&gt;&lt;ref name=\&quot;CPGID_00437\&quot;/&gt;&lt;ref name=\&quot;icu\&quot;/&gt;&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}},&quot;\n|-\n!&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-left1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-left1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;0x&lt;br/&gt;0&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:1}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-ctrl1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-ctrl1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+0&amp;#10;U+0000 NUL&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Null character&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{resize|85%|NUL}}&quot;},&quot;fn&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{Efn|0 draws a blank space, but usage as the [[C string handling|C string]] terminator means it is more accurately translated as NUL. In their code-page-437-based implementation of C0-region graphics, [[Star Micronics]] printers re-purpose this code as a [[slashed zero]].{{refn|{{cite web |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20040908060123/http://www.star-m.jp/eng/service/usermanual/lc8021um.pdf#page=61 |url=htt