ot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;25D8&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+8&amp;#10;U+25D8 INVERSE BULLET&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;◘&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:10}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;25CB&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+9&amp;#10;U+25CB WHITE CIRCLE&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;○&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;bullet (typography)&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:11}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;25D9&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+10&amp;#10;U+25D9 INVERSE WHITE CIRCLE&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;◙&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;bullet (typography)&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:12}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2642&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+11&amp;#10;U+2642 MALE SIGN&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{Emoji presentation|♂|text}}&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Gender symbol&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:13}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2640&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+12&amp;#10;U+2640 FEMALE SIGN&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{Emoji presentation|♀|text}}&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Gender symbol&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:14}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;266A&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+13&amp;#10;U+266A EIGHTH NOTE&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;♪&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:15}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;266B&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+14&amp;#10;U+266B BEAMED EIGHTH NOTES&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;♫&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;fn&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{Efn|14 (E&lt;sub&gt;hex&lt;/sub&gt;) Mapping as shown, to the beamed [[eighth note]]s [U+266B, ♫], follows data provided by the [[Unicode Consortium]].{{refn|{{cite web |url=https://www.unicode.org/Public/MAPPINGS/VENDORS/MISC/IBMGRAPH.TXT |title=IBM PC memory-mapped video graphics to Unicode |date=1999-07-27 |last=Whistler |first=Ken |publisher=[[Unicode Consortium]]}}}} In IBM's GCGID (Graphic Character Global IDentifier) system of character IDs, this is SM910000, simply annotated as \&quot;Two Musical Notes\&quot;;&lt;ref name=\&quot;cpgid437pdf\&quot;/&gt;&lt;ref name=\&quot;CPGID_00437\&quot;/&gt; however, the reference glyph shows two beamed [[sixteenth note]]s [U+266C, ♬].&lt;ref name=\&quot;cpgid437pdf\&quot;/&gt; In the specification for [[Japanese language in EBCDIC|IBM Japanese Host code]], SM910080 (i.e. SM910000 with the [[Halfwidth and fullwidth forms|fullwidth]] attribute set) is explicitly mapped to U+266C, and accordingly shows two semiquavers.{{refn|{{cite web |url=https://public.dhe.ibm.com/software/globalization/gcoc/attachments/CP00300.pdf |id=C-H 3-3220-024 2002-11 |year=2002 |publisher=[[IBM]] |title=IBM Japanese Graphic Character Set, Kanji: DBCS–Host and DBCS-PC}}}}}}&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:16}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;263C&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+15&amp;#10;U+263C WHITE SUN WITH RAYS&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;☼&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:17}},&quot;\n|-\n!&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-left1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-left1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;1x&lt;br/&gt;16&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:18}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;25BA&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Alt+16&amp;#10;U+25BA BLACK RIGHT-POINTING POINTER&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;►&quot;},&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;background:#EFF&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:19}},&quot;\n|&quot;,{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chset-cell1&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Chset-cell1&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;u&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;25C4&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quo